  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Editorial violet, compact operations",
    "overview": "People™ by Datlabs pairs warm paper and ink with violet selection and primary actions. Authentication retains the user-selected editorial violet direction, generous spacing and Newsreader display typography. The approved platform extension uses a clean, compact navigation frame and familiar system sans for frequent operational work.\n\nThis system records the approved frontend extension across every existing page: authentication, shared platform shell, responsive dashboards, lists, forms and Nuxt UI dialogs. Existing routes, APIs, permissions, calculations and actions remain the product boundary; presentation refinements do not add business capabilities. Existing People and Datlabs symbols and Lucide icons supply identity; the authentication HRMS diagram is native UI, with no new raster assets.",
