      },
      {
        "name": "Period and account support controls",
        "body": "Attendance and overtime can reset their selected period to the existing current-month default. Overtime and attendance charts use the same light/dark semantic ink colors as their status labels and remain static under reduced motion. Technical account support retains explicit Search submission; clearing search removes the submitted term while Reset filters restores the existing sorting defaults. Successful account rows remain visible during failed updates. Support dialogs use Nuxt UI structure, password visibility, inline request failures and disabled pending actions. Notifications expose a pending state for Mark all read and prevent duplicate actions.",
        "section": "components"
      },
      {
        "name": "Dashboard patterns across pages",
        "body": "Reuse divided summary surfaces with optional metric notes, warm flat records, compact lavender page selections, semantic status colors and readable table rows. Preserve every metric, action and existing API contract.",
        "section": "components"
