      {
        "name": "Resilient operational states",
        "body": "Filtered empty states offer Reset filters and return focus to the page search field. Clearing optional selections returns focus to their trigger. Operational inputs and dialog fields use 16px text on mobile; wrapping names and forced-color focus outlines remain readable. Summary numbers use grouped Indian-locale formatting without changing calculations, and chart tooltips stay inside their chart. Security settings distinguish status loading and failure, expose retry, retain loaded sessions, show inline credential errors and block duplicate or competing requests. The project uses 44px controls and visible, unobscured focus as design conventions; conformance still requires verification.",
